   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia Demo Phase III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia Education Progr.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta Diakonia-program syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja demokrati, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och j&#xe4;mlikhet genom utbildning och yrkeskompetens i nord&#xf6;stra och sydcentrala Somalia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Diakonia programme aims at promoting democracy, human rights, gender and equality through education and vocational skills in North East and South Central Somalia. It further aims at assisting communities in Puntland and South Central Somalia to develop a democratic society that will promote human rights, democratic principles and gender equity.</narrative>
  </description>
